# be-waizard

Study NestJS API (chat with a wizard). The Expo app does not live in this repository.

Before changing code or reviewing a feature, read `CLAUDE.md`, `docs/architecture.md`, and `docs/status.md`. The architecture doc is the contract; the status doc says what already exists.

The user implements each feature alone and asks for a review afterward. On review: name the problem and the smallest fix, in the user's language, without rewriting their solution and without implementing the next feature. Edit code only when they ask for implementation.

Out of scope: a second NPC, refresh tokens, XP, multiplayer, monetization, offline-first, mobile screens.
